# Local Manifests for Samsung Galaxy A04s (a04s)

This repository contains the local manifest to build LineageOS (or any AOSP-based ROM) for the Samsung Galaxy A04s (SM-A047F).

## Prerequisites

- A Linux machine (or WSL) with at least 16 GB RAM and 400 GB free storage.
- `repo` tool installed and initialized for LineageOS 23.2 (Android 16).

## Cloning the Manifests

Inside your Android source root directory (where you have `.repo`), run:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/michaelowusuntim6/local_manifests.git -b bka .repo/local_manifests
